  "notes": "USAGE:\n{反復|はんぷく} is a somewhat formal word often used in educational, scientific, and technical contexts. It can be used as a noun or as a suru-verb ({反復|はんぷく}する = to repeat).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {反復|はんぷく}{練習|れんしゅう} (repetitive practice, drilling)\n- {反復|はんぷく}{学習|がくしゅう} (repetitive learning)\n- {反復|はんぷく}する (to repeat, to iterate)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {繰|く}り{返|かえ}し: more everyday/casual term for repetition\n- {反復|はんぷく}: more formal/academic, often implies systematic repetition\n- {再発|さいはつ}: recurrence (used for diseases or problems, not for deliberate repetition)",
